# Copy to dashboard.env (ignored by git). Non-secret settings only. Tokens stay in your Windows user environment.
IMAGE_PROVIDER=deepix
VIDEO_PROVIDER=clipai
# AUDIO_PROVIDER follows VIDEO_PROVIDER=clipai when unset
# FFMPEG_PATH=C:\path\to\ffmpeg.exe
# CLIPAI_RESOLUTION=1080p
# DASHBOARD_PORT=8501
# Use mock providers to try the app without spending credits:
# IMAGE_PROVIDER=mock
# VIDEO_PROVIDER=mock
# AUDIO_PROVIDER=mock

# Claude chay bang Claude Code tren may nay (chua co ANTHROPIC_API_KEY; dung chung han muc Claude Code cua ban):
# LLM_PROVIDER=claude_cli

# Mo Dashboard bang cua so kieu app thay vi tab trinh duyet thuong (1 = bat)
# DASHBOARD_APP_WINDOW=1
# Cho may khac trong mang LAN vao (mac dinh chi may nay). Nguoi vao phai nhap e-mail (garena.vn) de dang nhap. Can mo firewall 1 lan: chay Open-LAN-Access.bat
# DASHBOARD_LAN=1
# Khi bat LAN (S14.7): thanh vien chi dang nhap duoc tu MAY PC da duoc Owner duyet (lan dau tu mot may -> yeu cau cho duyet o 👥 Nhom).
# May nhan qua DNS noi bo (IP -> ten may, kiem lai chieu thuan); khong xac dinh duoc ten may -> tu choi kem ly do. Sai qua 5 lan/10 phut tu
# mot IP -> cho. CANH BAO: reverse proxy / tunnel chay tren cung may lam moi nguoi trong nhu tu may chu (127.0.0.1) -> lop nay vo tac dung.
# Khi bat LAN: Owner dang nhap tu may khac phai nhap them ma nay (neu khong dat thi Owner chi dang nhap duoc tren chinh may chay Dashboard)
# DASHBOARD_OWNER_PASSCODE=
# Boi canh 3D (Kho tai nguyen -> Boi canh 3D, xem docs/HUONG_DAN_3D.md): thu muc file 3D va duong dan Blender (tu tim neu de trong)
# MODEL3D_DIR=D:\AI-Video-Pipeline\model 3D
# BLENDER_PATH=C:\Program Files\Blender Foundation\Blender 5.0\blender.exe
# Khoa Blender dung chung ca may (mac dinh trong thu muc tam cua he thong): moi luc chi 1 Blender render
# PLATES3D_LOCK=C:\Temp\ai_video_pipeline_blender.lock
# So video ClipAI chay cung luc toi da cho ca may (tai khoan ClipAI chi chay 2; 0 = khong gioi han); anh Deepix chua do
# THROTTLE_CAP_VIDEO_GEN=2
# THROTTLE_CAP_IMAGE_GEN=0
# Tinh nang moi dang TAT toi khi thu that (core/features.py): FEATURE_END_FRAMES=1, FEATURE_STORYBOARD_AUTO_TRUST=1, FEATURE_LOCATION_PLATES=1, FEATURE_STORYBOARD_API=1, FEATURE_LIP_SYNC=1, FEATURE_HERO_TAKES=1 (S0.14 T4: shot ⭐ gen 2 bản để chọn)
# Khop moi sau khi co clip (sync.so, goi API tu $5/thang): SYNC_API_KEY=... (SYNC_MODEL=lipsync-2-pro)
# Model do mat cho phu de (mac dinh data/models/face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx): FACE_MODEL=...
